This folder contains the code and configuration for the RapidsSE release automation.
It is called by Bamboo whenever the makerelease plan is executed.

Directory layout:
  ./xxx         description 1
  ./xxx         description 2


Prerequisites:
  (1) Latest version of Python (e.g 3.9)
  (2) pip       (python -m pip install)
  (3) pipenv    (pip install pipenv)

Other required Python packages are managed by pipenv.


